Store an electric charge for saving your life at a later time.

If you are reduced to less than zero life while this is active, it will deactivate, cure you of all stun/daze/freeze effects and allow you to survive with up to [195, 271, 329, 379, 423 (TL1-5; MP 100)] negative health for [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

The negative health limit scales with your Mindpower and maxium life.
